{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Tricorn Hat is a ",["l","帽子","hat"]," that can be purchased from ",["l","沙漠节","Elliott's shop"]," at the ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"]," for 100 Calico Eggs ",["l","卡利科三花蛋","Calico Egg"],"s. The player may purchase up to five Tricorn Hats from Elliott's shop in one day."]]]]]}